@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam state {
    BackgroundColor #50C878
    BorderColor #2D8659
    FontColor #FFFFFF
    StartColor #4A90E2
    EndColor #9B59B6
}

[*] --> Idle: App Start
Idle --> ChoosingSource: User Opens Screen
ChoosingSource --> Capturing: Camera Selected
ChoosingSource --> Selecting: Gallery Selected
Capturing --> Processing: Image Captured
Selecting --> Processing: Image Selected
Processing --> Converting: Image Processed
Converting --> SendingOCR: Base64 Converted
SendingOCR --> WaitingOCR: Request Sent
WaitingOCR --> OCRSuccess: Response Received
WaitingOCR --> OCRError: Request Failed
OCRError --> Retrying: User Retries
Retrying --> SendingOCR
OCRSuccess --> Extracting: Parse Response
Extracting --> Tokenizing: Text Extracted
Tokenizing --> Translating: Words Tokenized
Translating --> TranslatingWord: Translate Next
TranslatingWord --> CheckingCache: Word Ready
CheckingCache --> UsingCache: Cached
CheckingCache --> CallingAPI: Not Cached
UsingCache --> Translating: Continue
CallingAPI --> Translating: Continue
Translating --> AllTranslated: All Done
AllTranslated --> Displaying: Show Results
Displaying --> UserAction: Results Shown
UserAction --> Copying: User Copies
UserAction --> Sharing: User Shares
UserAction --> NewImage: New Image
Copying --> Displaying: Return
Sharing --> Displaying: Return
NewImage --> ChoosingSource: Restart
Displaying --> [*]: User Closes

note right of Translating
    States:
    - extractedText
    - translations
    - loading
    - error
end note

@enduml
